        <div class="col-12 col-lg-7">
          <h2 class="heading-border heading-center heading-left mb-4 pb-3 d-inline-block">The Challenge</h2>
          <p class="large-para mb-3">
            Multi-location dental clinics face a tripling problem: front desk staff overwhelmed by scheduling calls, providers drowning in post-visit documentation, and patient data siloed across spreadsheets and an EHR that doesn't talk to anything.
          </p>
          <p class="large-para mb-3">
            The specific pain points: a 35% appointment no-show rate driven by friction in booking and no automated reminders. Providers spending 1-2 hours per day after hours writing SOAP notes, what clinicians call "pajama time." Scheduling happening outside the EHR, causing sync failures and double-bookings. And a front desk that couldn't handle after-hours calls at all, sending urgent patient inquiries to voicemail.
          </p>
          <p class="large-para mb-0">
            The client needed a single platform that handled scheduling (web + voice), clinical documentation, EHR integration, and HIPAA compliance across multiple clinic locations, built to a standard where a compliance auditor could review every control.
          </p>
        </div>
