              <li><strong>Voice stack:</strong> Twilio + Deepgram Nova-2 + ElevenLabs + Claude</li>
              <li><strong>EHR:</strong> athenahealth FHIR R4 (real-time bi-directional sync)</li>
              <li><strong>Timeline:</strong> 8 weeks, 2 developers using Cursor</li>
              <li><strong>Result 1:</strong> No-show rate 35% → 6%</li>
              <li><strong>Result 2:</strong> $28,000/month in recovered revenue</li>
